  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Deep in Myriad Statue Palace, Thousand Transformations Ancestor names Cutting Flesh Transformation as one style of the immortal killer move suicide transformation from Reckless Savage true inheritance: life forms produced from his body are portions of that body and can normally be manipulated like limbs. He also credits an Immortal Gu House left by Reckless Savage Demon Venerable with letting him survive his first myriad tribulation. A thousand years earlier he had relied on this Reckless Savage true inheritance and thought he would progress unhindered, until the myriad tribulation showed him he had underestimated it.",
      "chapters": [
        1398
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_myriad_statue_palace",
        "char_thousand_transformations_ancestor",
        "move_cutting_flesh_transformation",
        "sys_immortal_gu_house",
        "char_reckless_savage_demon_venerable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Thousand Transformations Ancestor inherited a Reckless Savage true inheritance whose core is Mutation Immortal Gu; without it he would have a hard time activating most of its methods and their strength would fall greatly. Fang Yuan judges that the yellow-cloud defense around the dream realm is probably a portion of Reckless Savage’s true inheritance; that formation is the myriad li adaptation formation of Reckless Savage’s true inheritance, a genuine rank eight formation.",
      "chapters": [
        1872
      ],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "core-and-formation",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_mutation_immortal_gu",
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Feng Jiu Ge tells Fang Yuan that in Heavenly Court’s Embroidered Tower there are three true inheritances left by Reckless Savage Demon Venerable, each requiring a key: attitude Gu, mutation Gu, and adaptation Gu.",
      "chapters": [
        1963
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "core-and-formation",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_feng_jiu_ge",
        "fac_heavenly_court",
        "house_embroidered_tower",
        "gu_attitude_gu",
        "gu_mutation_gu",
        "gu_adaptation_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Fang Yuan steals Thousand Transformations Ancestor’s rank eight Mutation Immortal Gu from the dream realm, Thousand Transformations Ancestor leaves Myriad Statue Palace to kill him.",
      "chapters": [
        1875
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "theft-and-pursuit",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "When three lights merge into a blood red cape on Fang Yuan, allies and enemies are shocked and conclude that he seems to have inherited Reckless Savage true inheritance.",
      "chapters": [
        1956
      ],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "theft-and-pursuit",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Demon Immortal Qi Jue lists Reckless Savage’s true inheritance among the venerable true inheritances Fang Yuan possesses.",
      "chapters": [
        2054
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "theft-and-pursuit",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_demon_immortal_qi_jue"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Meng Qiu Zhen recalls that the gluttonous demon frog intestine tunnel leads to the place where Reckless Savage Demon Venerable left his true inheritance, Myriad Beast Fusion Color Heaven.",
      "chapters": [
        2095
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "where-it-was-hidden",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_meng_qiu_zhen",
        "loc_myriad_beast_fusion_color_heaven"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Historical records say that in his old age Reckless Savage Demon Venerable used lingering beastmen to create Reckless Savage grotto-heaven and left his true inheritance inside it.",
      "chapters": [
        2105
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "where-it-was-hidden",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Huang Jin tribe Gu Immortals discussing Chu Du versus Fairy Black Moon say that Fairy Black Moon seems to have inherited Reckless Savage’s true inheritance and that her strength path attainment cannot be underestimated.",
      "chapters": [
        2203
      ],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "fairy-black-moon-rumor",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
